                                             "message":  "Release v1.5.4: fix static-guard pan ghosting and scene-cut recovery\n\nfix(runtime): gate the static guard by motion. The 1.5.0 wHalo term engaged\nthe guard near flat-colour regions regardless of motion, blending panning\ncontent toward the unwarped frame average and doubling/ghosting moving line\nart (anime pans). wStatic is now scaled by (1 - smoothstep(0.5, 1.0, motion)),\nso static text stays protected at motion~0 while moving content is left to the\ninterpolation. Mirrored into web/rt/rt.js.\n\nfix(extension): recover smoothly from hard scene cuts. Bridge the just-captured\nframe\u0027s presentation slot across a confirmed rate-plan transition (it was\ndropped with the in-flight pair decision), and pad the presentation delay by a\nfast-attack/slow-decay lateness tail so delivery bursts are pre-buffered instead\nof becoming a ~0.5s drop burst.\n\nfeat(extension): add a Flow upsample mode (edge/gate/bilinear) for the texture\nflow-upsample path; default edge keeps current behaviour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
